.\"","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"11:47","t":"[Noah] said, \"My Lord, I seek refuge in You from asking that of which I have no knowledge. And unless You forgive me and have mercy upon me, I will be among the losers.\"","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"11:48","t":"It was said, \"O Noah, disembark in security from Us and blessings upon you and upon nations [descending] from those with you. But other nations [of them] We will grant enjoyment; then there will touch them from Us a painful punishment.\"","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"11:49","t":"That is from the news of the unseen which We reveal to you, [O Muḥammad]. You knew it not, neither you nor your people, before this. So be patient; indeed, the [best] outcome is for the righteous.","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"11:50","t":"And to ʿAad [We sent] their brother Hūd. He said, \"O my people, worship Allāh; you have no deity other than Him. You are not but inventors [of falsehood].","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"11:51","t":"O my people, I do not ask you for it [i.e., my advice] any reward. My reward is only from the one who created me. Then will you not reason?","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"11:52","t":"And O my people, ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in showers and increase you in strength [added] to your strength. And do not turn away, [being] criminals.\"","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"11:53","t":"They said, \"O Hūd, you have not brought us clear evidence, and we are not ones to leave our gods on your say-so. Nor are we believers in you.","j":12,"h":23,"s":11,"a":53,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":23,"surahs":[11],"sajdah":false}